WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.801
- So I'm going to ask
you a few questions here.

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:02.634
- Okay.

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:05.370
- I want you to name a
number between one and 10.

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.440
Now, most people name seven.
- Oh.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.370
- That's the number they name the most,

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.240
but you can name any number you want.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.690
One, two, three, four, five, six,

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:14.370
seven, eight nine, or 10.

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:15.480
- You want me to... Four.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:16.840
- Four. You wanna change your mind?

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:17.860
- Nope.
- Sure?

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:20.260
- Yeah, I'm very certain.
- Okay. Want black or red?

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:21.730
- What?
- Black or red?

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:22.600
- Oh, red.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.350
- Red. Okay, you wanna change your mind?

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.183
- No.

00:00:25.183 --> 00:00:26.520
- Do you want diamonds or hearts?

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:27.836
- Diamonds, April. Hello.

00:00:27.836 --> 00:00:29.110
- Diamonds?
- Yes.

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:30.630
- Wanna change your mind?
- No.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.340
- You say the four of diamonds.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.173
- Four of diamonds.

00:00:33.173 --> 00:00:34.748
- Four of diamonds is what you've chosen.

00:00:34.748 --> 00:00:35.581
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:35.581 --> 00:00:36.414
- You wanna change your mind?
- No.

00:00:36.414 --> 00:00:37.247
- You're gonna think back on this.

00:00:37.247 --> 00:00:38.080
You wanna change your mind?

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:38.950
- No.
- Okay.

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:41.360
Now I've got these three songs here.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.680
Which one do you want there?

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.677
Name one of them.

00:00:43.677 --> 00:00:44.950
- "Stronger".

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:45.783
- You say "Stronger".

00:00:45.783 --> 00:00:46.630
- Yes.
- Okay.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:47.900
- You ready, Teller?

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.797
Here comes "Stronger".

00:00:50.695 --> 00:00:51.570
- Oh, okay.
(applause and cheering)

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:52.800
- We have two others here.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.730
We got "Stronger" on the knife.

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:55.970
We got "A Moment Like This"

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:57.623
and "Piece by Piece" here.
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:57.623 --> 00:00:59.210
It's amazing. Yeah.

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:01.580
- Now I want you to see this one here.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:05.993
If we took this and cut it open, like so,

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.500
you would see in the middle of that,

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.863
you would see nothing but
citrus goodness there.

00:01:12.863 --> 00:01:13.696
- Yeah.

00:01:13.696 --> 00:01:16.571
- Now if we took this one,
"A Moment Like This" --

00:01:16.571 --> 00:01:17.404
- Yeah.

00:01:17.404 --> 00:01:19.523
- -- and cut this one open --
- Okay.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:22.960
- -- you would see nothing in there --

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:25.250
- Oh, yeah.
- -- but citrus goodness.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:28.010
But "Stronger" which
is the one you chose --

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:29.440
- Yeah. Oh my God.

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:31.720
If you think that a card is in...

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:33.970
